or per-invocation error log |\\n| **Tool/Token Cost** | `T4` | Tool-call cou...[truncated, 30723 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

