data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Daily Monitor — Day 01\\n## Task Family: `duplicate_merge_probe`\\n\\n**Date:** 2026-05-25  \\n**Run scope:** Bounded filesystem evidence only. Generic, application-neutral.  \\n**Method:** Slug similarity, trigger/description overlap, procedure overlap, telemetry evidence cross-reference.  \\n**No skills were mutated, created, or deleted in this report.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Inventory Summary\\n\\nThe `available_skills/` directory contains **26 skill directories** as of this scan. They break into the following clusters for duplicate analysis:\\n\\n| Cluster | Count | Directories |\\n|---------|-------|-------------|\\n| **Figma design** | 2 | `figma`, `figma_mcp` |\\n| **GitNexus** | 7 | `gitnexus_cli`, `gitnexus_debugging`, `gitnexus_exploring`, `gitnexus_guide`, `gitnexus_impact_analysis`, `gitnexus_pr_review`, `gitnexus_refactoring` |\\n| **Materialization pipeline** | 3 | `materialization_activation_telemetry_registry`, `materialization_proposal_linked_skill_package_registry_load_path`, `materialization_skill_package_registry_load_path_usage_telemetry` |\\n| **Telemetry** | 1 | `telemetry_optimization` |\\n| **Experimental auto-generated** | 5 | `skill-exp-052e6a93-9680-4a98-bc7a-441abfc18c46-1779612141421504000`, `skill-exp-2b07b1df-173c-47ad-aa62-8a076cd6c26c-1779618706105440000`, `skill-exp-4d613241-8b59-45ad-8daa-d5cb5dc1fb3e-1779613286395772000`, `skill_exp_0bd3b7f3_6797_40d8_ba1a_d53409bb4536_1779616302740038000`, `skill_exp_1590b4d7_0aa7_4d87_ad40_14e222b2394b_1779614687697856000` |\\n| **Financial market** | 2 | `stock_analysis`, `crypto_market` |\\n| **Development tools** | 5 | `chronicle`, `golang`, `openspec`, `playwright_mcp`, `shadcn_ui` |\\n| **Data/utility** | 1 | `weather` |\\n\\nAdditionally, the `skills/` mirror directory (promotion source) contains **4 overlapping entries** — these are the same materialization + telemetry skills in a different lifecycle state, not duplicates.\\n\\n**Skills with `_meta.json` convention compliance:** 4 of...[truncated, 29115 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

