asurement infrastructure, not true inactivity).\\n\\n### 1.1 — Canonical Data So...[truncated, 28368 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

