data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Agent Skill 优化·合并·归档规则\\n## Incremental Artifact — Post-Precipitation Lifecycle Governance\\n\\n**Purpose:** Provide generic, application-agnostic rules for managing the post-precipitation lifecycle of governed skills. This artifact defines *how* to optimize existing skills based on task telemetry, *how* to identify and merge duplicate skills, and *how* to archive inactive skills. Every rule includes auditable criteria, explicit threshold fields, and mandatory rollback record fields.\\n\\n**Relation to predecessor artifacts:** This artifact is an **incremental companion** to `shared/self_evolution_agent_skill_precipitation_checklist.md`. That checklist governs *creation* and *promotion* of a skill artifact (Phases 0–8). This artifact governs the *ongoing maintenance* of skills already precipitated — optimization, deduplication, and retirement. No baseline checklist content is duplicated here.\\n\\n**Predecessor artifacts (evidence chain):**\\n- `self_evolution_agent_skill_precipitation_checklist.md` — precipitation phases 0–8, scoring, classification\\n- `self_evolution_observation_runbook_0.md` — triple-marker verification protocol\\n- `self_evolution_reuse_observation_4.md` — reuse evidence inspection\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Table of Contents\\n\\n1. [Governance Scope & Lifecycle Model](#1-governance-scope--lifecycle-model)\\n2. [Domain A — Skill Optimization via Task Telemetry](#2-domain-a--skill-optimization-via-task-telemetry)\\n3. [Domain B — Duplicate Skill Identification & Merge](#3-domain-b--duplicate-skill-identification--merge)\\n4. [Domain C — Inactive Skill Archival](#4-domain-c--inactive-skill-archival)\\n5. [Unified Audit & Rollback Schema](#5-unified-audit--rollback-schema)\\n6. [Quick-Reference Threshold Glossary](#6-quick-reference-threshold-glossary)\\n7. [Artifact Metadata](#7-artifact-metadata)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Governance Scope & Lifecycle Model\\n\\n### 1.1 — Lifecycle State Machine\\n\\nEvery governed skill SHALL be in exac...[truncated, 44259 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

