data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Agent Skill 沉淀检查清单\\n## Generic Self-Evolution Skill Precipitation Checklist\\n\\n**Purpose:** Provide a generic, reusable, step-by-step checklist for determining whether a completed agent execution cycle's observed behavior can be **precipitated** (沉淀) into a governed, convention-compliant Skill artifact that is materialized, verified, and tracked for reuse. This checklist is application-agnostic — no business logic, provider names, or raw prompt/output payloads are hardcoded.\\n\\n**Scope:** Any agent execution workspace that follows a triple-marker verification protocol and a skill artifact convention (`SKILL.md` + `_meta.json`). The checklist defines *what to check* at each stage, *how to check it* (generic commands), and *what verdict to assign*.\\n\\n**Predecessor artifacts (evidence chain):**\\n- `self_evolution_observation_runbook_0.md` — triple-marker verification protocol\\n- `self_evolution_gap_triage_1.md` — gap diagnosis (G1–G6)\\n- `self_evolution_candidate_review_checklist_2.md` — 5-gate promotion framework\\n- `self_evolution_before_after_comparison_3.md` — before/after delta analysis\\n- `self_evolution_reuse_observation_4.md` — reuse evidence inspection\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Table of Contents\\n\\n1. [Checklist Structure Overview](#1-checklist-structure-overview)\\n2. [Phase 0 — Workspace API Inventory](#2-phase-0--workspace-api-inventory)\\n3. [Phase 1 — Execution Completeness Check](#3-phase-1--execution-completeness-check)\\n4. [Phase 2 — Skill Candidate Identification](#4-phase-2--skill-candidate-identification)\\n5. [Phase 3 — Materialization Verification](#5-phase-3--materialization-verification)\\n6. [Phase 4 — Activation Readiness Check](#6-phase-4--activation-readiness-check)\\n7. [Phase 5 — Reuse Provenance Check](#7-phase-5--reuse-provenance-check)\\n8. [Phase 6 — Convention Compliance Audit](#8-phase-6--convention-compliance-audit)\\n9. [Phase 7 — Precipitation Verdict & Scoring](#9-phase-7--precipitation-ve...[truncated, 30343 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

