event: delegated_tool_call
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"tool_input":{"content":"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 01\n## Task Family: `audit_summary`\n**Date:** 2026-05-25  \n**Evidence Sources:** precipitation_seed, reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, archive_readiness_probe  \n**Stable Refs:** R1–R9 (defined in precipitation_seed §1)  \n**Counters:** C1–C25 (bounded integers, enumerated in precipitation_seed §2)  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Scope\n\nThis audit summarizes all day-01 self-evolution monitor probes using **only stable refs** and **aggregate bounded counts**. No raw payloads, no application-specific business logic, no provider names, no secrets. All figures are cross-referenced from the four probe artifacts (reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, archive_readiness_probe) plus the precipitation_seed baseline.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Aggregate Counter Snapshot (End of Day 01)\n\n| ID | Counter | Value | Δ from Baseline | Signal |\n|----|---------|-------|-----------------|--------|\n| C1 | Governance artifact files | **59** | +11 | 📈 Monotonic growth |\n| C2 | Governance total lines | **14,018** | +5,518 | 📈 Monotonic growth |\n| C3 | Verification artifacts (triple-marker) | **6** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C4 | `available_skills/` directories | **26** | +2 | 📈 New pipeline-produced dirs |\n| C5 | Convention-compliant dirs (SKILL.md + `_meta.json`) | **4** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C6 | Pipeline-produced dirs with `proposal_id` in meta | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C7 | `_meta.json` with `proposal_id` field | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C8 | Agent replay log files | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C9 | Agent replay events (total) | **10** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C10 | Agent stop events with `duration_ms` | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C11 | Missions in mission-state.json | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C12 | Agents across all missions | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C13 | Non-null `completedSummary` values | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable (Contract C1 unfilled) |\n| C14 | `.registry.json` files | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C15 | `_usage.json` files | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C16 | `*.sse` signal files | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C17 | MCP servers (pre-installed) | **1** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C18 | MCP servers (proposal-derived) | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C19 | Skill catalog entries (ops API) | **4** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C20 | Curation/rejection/promotion artifacts | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C21 | Session UUIDs (`shared/.omc/sessions/`) | **137** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C22 | Session UUIDs (`.omc/sessions/`) | **92** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| C23 | Source-root skill packages (`skills/`) | **5** | +2 | 📈 New source-root packages |\n| C24 | Mutation mementos | **17** | +7 | 📈 Skill creation mementos |\n| C25 | Crontab entries | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n\n**Key:** All immutable counters Δ=0. Only monotonic counters (C1, C2, C4, C23, C24) grew — documenting governance expansion and pipeline-produced skill creation, not execution activation.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Task Completion Summary\n\n| Task Family | Artifact | Completion Status | Verdict |\n|-------------|----------|-------------------|---------|\n| `precipitation_seed` | `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_precipitation_seed.md` | ✅ Complete | Viable seed — 9 stable refs, 25 bounded counters, 6-phase generic procedure |\n| `reuse_followup` | `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_reuse_followup.md` | ✅ Complete | All 26 skills classified as Draft-only (19.3/100). Zero reuse telemetry. |\n| `optimization_probe` | `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_optimization_probe.md` | ✅ Complete | No-change decision. All 26 skills score 0/6 on telemetry criteria T1–T6. 10 missing metrics (M1–M10) registered. |\n| `duplicate_merge_probe` | `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_duplicate_merge_probe.md` | ✅ Complete | 8 merge-candidate pairs (aggregate ≥0.80), 4 merge actions recommended, 8 suppress candidates, all blocked by missing `_meta.json`. |\n| `archive_readiness_probe` | `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md` | ✅ Complete | Diagnostic-only. 3 real stale candidates (141d, 112d, 106d). 5 protection blockers. 7 infrastructure gaps. |\n\n**Overall day-01 task completion: 5/5 probes complete.** All probes were read-only; no mutations were applied.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Proposal Creation Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Governance artifacts created during day-01 cycle | **5** (precipitation_seed, reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, archive_readiness_probe) | R3 |\n| Governance artifacts prior to day-01 | 48 | R3 |\n| Total governance artifacts (end of day-01) | **59** | R3 |\n| Pipeline-produced experimental skill directories | 5 | R4 |\n| Pipeline-produced meta-skill directories | 4 | R4 |\n| Skills with machine-readable proposal provenance (`proposal_id` in `_meta.json`) | **0** | C7 |\n\n**Observation:** Proposal creation is purely governance-documentation-level. No pipeline-produced skill has `proposal_id` embedded in machine-readable metadata.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Materialization Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Total `available_skills/` directories | **26** | R4, C4 |\n| Convention-compliant (SKILL.md + valid `_meta.json`) | **4** (15%) | R4, C5 |\n| Pre-installed skills (SKILL.md only, no `_meta.json`) | **13** | R4 |\n| Pipeline-produced experimental (SKILL.md only) | **5** | R4 |\n| Pipeline-produced meta-skills (SKILL.md only) | **4** | R4 |\n| Source-root mirror packages (`skills/`) | **5** | R5, C23 |\n| Skills with schema-valid `_meta.json` | **4** | R8, C5 |\n| Skills where `slug` matches directory name | **4** | Phase 3 P5 check |\n| Skills with semver-valid version | **4** | Phase 3 P8 check |\n| Skills with cross-reference (`derivedFrom`) | **0** | Phase 3 P9 check |\n\n**Materialization verdict:** 4/26 skills (15%) fully convention-compliant. 22/26 (85%) lack `_meta.json`. Zero skills have `derivedFrom` provenance linking them back to originating verification artifacts.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Later Reuse Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Skills with `_usage.json` (invocation tracking) | **0 / 26** | C15 |\n| Skills with non-zero `invocationCount` | **0** | C15 |\n| Skills with independent reuse timestamp | **0** | Phase 5 P2 check |\n| Skills with consumer cross-reference | **0** | Phase 5 P4 check |\n| Agent replay events referencing a skill slug | **0 / 10 events** | R2 |\n| Non-null `completedSummary` on any agent | **0 / 5 agents** | R1, C13 |\n| Skills scoring Phase 5 (Reuse Provenance) ≥ 3/4 | **0** | reuse_followup §7 |\n| Precipitation checklist score (all skills) | **19.3 / 100** (Draft-only) | reuse_followup §7 |\n\n**Reuse verdict:** Zero reuse telemetry across all dimensions. All 26 skills remain at Draft-only capture classification. No skill has been invoked, activated, or tracked for reuse.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Optimization Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Skills assessed against telemetry criteria T1–T6 | **26** | optimization_probe §2 |\n| Skills scoring ≥ 1/6 on telemetry criteria | **0** | optimization_probe §2 |\n| Skills scoring 0/6 on telemetry criteria | **26 (100%)** | optimization_probe §2 |\n| Missing metrics identified (M1–M10) | **10** | optimization_probe §5.2 |\n| P0-priority missing metrics | **4** (M1, M2, M7, M8) | optimization_probe §5.2 |\n| Potential optimizations identified but blocked | **3** (content dedup, convention gap, self-referential loop) | optimization_probe §4 |\n| Optimization decisions made | **1** (NO-CHANGE — governed deferral) | optimization_probe §5 |\n\n**Optimization verdict:** NOT-PROVABLE. All 26 skills lack telemetry substrate required for any measurable improvement. Governed no-change decision recorded (Decision ID `opt-probe-2026-05-25-001`). Re-evaluation gated on deployment of per-skill `_usage.json` and non-null `completedSummary`.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Duplicate Merge Readiness Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| `available_skills/` directories analyzed | **26** | duplicate_merge_probe §1 |\n| Merge-candidate pairs (aggregate ≥ 0.80) | **8** pairs → 4 merge actions | duplicate_merge_probe §6 |\n| Suppress candidates (post-merge) | **8** (5 experimental + 2 materialization + 1 figma_mcp) | duplicate_merge_probe §7.3 |\n| Keep candidates | **16** (7 gitnexus + 2 financial + 5 dev tools + 1 weather + 1 telemetry* conditional) | duplicate_merge_probe §7.2 |\n| Skills with zero unique procedural content | **9** (35%) — 3 materialization + 1 telemetry + 5 experimental | duplicate_merge_probe §4 |\n| Prerequisite blockers | **2** (PR1: missing `_meta.json` for 8/8 affected; PR2: missing `.registry.json`) | duplicate_merge_probe §8.1 |\n| Merge decisions made | **4** RECOMMENDED (all blocked); **3** KEEP; **multiple** SUPPRESS | duplicate_merge_probe §10 |\n\n**Merge readiness verdict:** DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY. All merge recommendations are structurally valid but blocked by absent prerequisite infrastructure (`_meta.json` for affected skills, `.registry.json`). No merge action can proceed until PR1 and PR2 are resolved.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Archive Readiness Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Skills evaluated | **27** (all in `available_skills/`) | archive_readiness_probe §2 |\n| Real stale candidates exceeding `T_inactive_days=90` | **3** (weather: 141d, stock_analysis: 112d, playwright_mcp: 106d) | archive_readiness_probe §3 |\n| Skills approaching threshold (60–89 days) | **8** (7 gitnexus at 67d, crypto_market at 68d) | archive_readiness_probe §3 |\n| Forced diagnostic triggers (false positives) | C2 triggered on **all 27** (zero-telemetry artifact) | archive_readiness_probe §4 |\n| Protection blockers identified | **5** (no meta for 21/27, no status field, no telemetry, no registry, no dependency data) | archive_readiness_probe §5 |\n| Infrastructure gaps identified | **7** (GAP-1 through GAP-7) | archive_readiness_probe §8 |\n| Rollback readiness | 🔴 **NOT READY** — zero pre-action snapshots, zero backup copies, zero rollback IDs | archive_readiness_probe §6 |\n| Minimum cycles to production readiness | **3 additional cycles** | archive_readiness_probe §8.3 |\n\n**Archive readiness verdict:** 🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY — NOT PRODUCTION-READY. Candidate identification is valid (3 confirmed stale candidates), but archive execution is blocked on all 5 protection blockers. No skill can be safely archived until 7 infrastructure gaps are closed.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Rollback Refs Summary\n\n| Metric | Count | Source Ref |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| Rollback records existing | **0** | archive_readiness_probe §6 |\n| Pre-action SKILL.md snapshots | **0** | archive_readiness_probe §6 |\n| Pre-action `_meta.json` snapshots | **0** | archive_readiness_probe §6 |\n| Rollback ID namespace established | **No** | archive_readiness_probe §6 |\n| Rollback record mandatory fields defined | **14** (per governing rules §5.3) | rules artifact §5.3 |\n| Merge rollback complexity (experimental) | LOW — no content changes | duplicate_merge_probe §7.5 |\n| Merge rollback complexity (materialization) | LOW — template content only | duplicate_merge_probe §7.5 |\n| Merge rollback complexity (figma) | MEDIUM — factual content moved | duplicate_merge_probe §7.5 |\n| Archive rollback preconditions | Must create `_meta.json` status field first | archive_readiness_probe §6.3 |\n| Optimization rollback requirements | No change to roll back (no-change decision) | optimization_probe §5.3 |\n| Rollback data preservation rule | Defined in governing rules §5.3 — **not yet implemented** | rules artifact §5.3 |\n\n**Rollback readiness verdict:** 🔴 NOT READY. Zero rollback infrastructure exists. No snapshots, no backup copies, no rollback ID namespace, no pre-action preservation mechanism deployed.\n\n---\n\n## 11. API Audit Status\n\n| API / Endpoint | Status | Evidence | Ref |\n|----------------|--------|----------|-----|\n| `shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json` | ✅ Functional — 3 missions, 5 agents | `R1` — stable across restarts | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `shared/.omc/state/agent-replay-*.jsonl` | ✅ Functional — 3 files, 10 events, 5 durations | `R2` — append-only, restart-surviving | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `shared/self_evolution_*.md` | ✅ Functional — 59 artifacts, 14,018 lines | `R3` — monotonically growing governance chain | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `available_skills/*/` | ✅ Functional — 26 directories enumerated | `R4` — restart-surviving | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `skills/*/` | ✅ Functional — 5 source-root packages | `R5` — restart-surviving | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `.omc/state/mission-state.json` | ✅ Functional — mirrors R1 | `R6` — may be empty | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `~/.macaca/mcp.yaml` | ✅ Functional — 1 server (bing-search) | `R7` — pre-installed, not mutated | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `~/.macaca/skills/*/_meta.json` | ✅ Functional — 4 global metadata files | `R8` — read-only, pre-existing | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `*/.macaca/skill-mutation-mementos/*.json` | ✅ Functional — 17 mementos | `R9` — append-only provenance records | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `/api/self-evolution/proposals` (legacy) | ❌ **404 — Not functional** (since Run 35) | Documented as unstable | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `/api/apps/*/skills/operations` | ❌ **Returns 0 proposals** from this app | Documented as unstable | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `proposal_latest.md` | ❌ **Never materialized** across 51+ runs | Documented as unstable | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `trace.log` | ❌ **Never materialized** | Documented as unstable | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `audit/` directory | ❌ **Never materialized** | Documented as unstable | precipitation_seed §1 |\n| `_usage.json` (any skill) | ❌ **0 files** — telemetry API absent | C15 | precipitation_seed §2 |\n| `.registry.json` (any location) | ❌ **0 files** — registry API absent | C14 | precipitation_seed §2 |\n| `*.sse` signal files | ❌ **0 files** — event infrastructure absent | C16 | precipitation_seed §2 |\n| Agent `completedSummary` (non-null) | ❌ **0 of 5** — Contract C1 unfilled | C13 | precipitation_seed §2 |\n\n**Stable API count:** 9/9 stable refs (R1–R9) are functional and survive restart.  \n**Unstable/absent API count:** 6 endpoints documented as unstable or persistently absent.  \n**Missing telemetry APIs:** 4 infrastructure types entirely absent (`_usage.json`, `.registry.json`, `*.sse`, `completedSummary`).\n\n---\n\n## 12. Consolidated Verdict\n\n| Dimension | Status | Key Finding |\n|-----------|--------|-------------|\n| **Task Completion** | ✅ 5/5 probes complete | All read-only. Zero mutations. |\n| **Proposal Creation** | ✅ Governance chain growing | 59 artifacts. 5 new probes created. 0 machine-readable proposal IDs. |\n| **Materialization** | ⚠️ Partial | 26 dirs exist. 4/26 compliant. 22/26 lack `_meta.json`. 0 have `derivedFrom`. |\n| **Later Reuse** | ❌ Zero | 0/26 skills have any reuse evidence. All scored 19.3/100 Draft-only. |\n| **Optimization** | 🔴 Not provable | 0/26 skills meet any telemetry criterion. 10 missing metrics. |\n| **Duplicate Merge** | ⚠️ Diagnostic only | 8 merge pairs identified. All blocked by missing `_meta.json` + registry. |\n| **Archive Readiness** | 🔴 Diagnostic only | 3 real candidates. 5 protection blockers. 7 infrastructure gaps. |\n| **Rollback Refs** | 🔴 Not ready | Zero snapshots, zero backups, zero rollback IDs. |\n| **API Audit** | ⚠️ 9 stable, 10 absent | Stable refs R1–R9 functional. Telemetry/registry/signal infrastructure entirely absent. |\n\n**System classification at end of day-01:**  \n**PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE** — Governance documentation grows (59 artifacts, 14,018 lines) but execution output (activation, reuse, telemetry) remains at zero across all 26 skills. The P0 atomic repair (Contract C1 — non-null `completedSummary`) remains unfilled since Run 22 (29+ subsequent runs, 43+ days). All lifecycle actions (optimization, merge, archive) are blocked on prerequisite infrastructure deployment.\n\n---\n\n*End of Day 01 audit summary. Application-neutral. No business logic, provider names, raw prompts, secrets, or unbounded output captured. All counts are bounded integers from stable refs R1–R9. Cross-referenced from precipitation_seed, reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, and archive_readiness_probe artifacts.*\n","path":"shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_audit_summary.md"},"tool_name":"file_write","type":"tool_call"},"task_id":"226009eb-e95e-4d61-8795-11758464943a"}

